    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Can be read to produce the Casting of a Spell, with the reader declaring the Target(s). Doing so costs no Mana, doesn't require a Check, and causes the scroll to vaporize.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Crafting a Spell Scroll requires that the crafter knows the Spell and would be able to perform that Casting of it when crafting it, and can be done with the Study activity.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Mana: Value</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">0: 10g</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">1: 25g</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">2: 250g</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">3: 500g</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">4: 1,000g</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">5: 5,000g</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">6: 10,000g</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">7+: +10,000g / Mana</span></p>",
